<Base title="About JP Perez" description="AE and Product Owner at a CPQ vendor, building AI systems. MSc, four working languages, based in Antwerp.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    My core strength is communication across the three sides of a software project: with the client in
    discovery and commercial talks, with project management on scope and priorities, and with the
    development team on what is technically feasible.
  </p>
  <p>
    Since 2022 I have been Account Executive and Product Owner at Nestoya, a vendor of rule-driven CPQ
    and digital-twin software modeled to client needs. I run discovery, solution design, demos and POCs,
    C-level closing and expansion, and I closed more than €600K. As Product Owner I turn customer
    requirements into specs and business cases and drive them to working software, bridging sales,
    product and engineering.
  </p>
  <p>
    In 2025 I started building with AI tooling seriously: agentic workflows, MCP tool connectors, and
    evaluation loops. The builds on this site are working systems I designed, shipped and operated,
    not tutorials. I am not a formally trained software engineer; I am the person who scopes the
    solution, prototypes it, builds the business case, and keeps everyone aligned until value is delivered.
  </p>
